      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BE MY TIGER (1) scored (20.31) last time out at Traralgon in a Mix 6/7 and will break from box 1 for the first time. Well placed and will be tough to beat. WARATAH LAD (3) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing fifth (20.26) in a Mix 6/7 at Healesville. Can find the frame this time. TRIVIA MASTER (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (19.91) at Healesville behind Dundee Rex in a T3 RSTW. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Expected to be in the finish again. TOWN LEGEND (7) has been in the frame at his last two runs, most recently when second (23.55) in a Rank Limit - Grade 6 over 400m at this track.",
